519\", \"rights_status\": \"pending_registry_review\", \"version\": \"2026-09\"}, {\"citation\": \"《續傳燈錄》卷5：「雪竇顯禪師法嗣……海會擇芝禪師」(CBETA, T51, no. 2077, p. 499, a12-b5)\", \"code\": \"DILA\", \"id\": \"relation_14\", \"record_id\": \"A000885:A025520\", \"rights_status\": \"pending_registry_review\", \"version\": \"2026-09\"}, {\"citation\": \"《續傳燈錄》卷5：「雪竇顯禪師法嗣……長蘆智福禪師」(CBETA, T51, no. 2077, p. 499, a12-18)\", \"code\": \"DILA\", \"id\": \"relation_15\", \"record_id\": \"A000885:A025521\", \"rights_status\": \"pending_registry_review\", \"version\": \"2026-09\"}, {\"citation\": \"《續傳燈錄》卷5：「雪竇顯禪師法嗣……嶽林宗善禪師」(CBETA, T51, no. 2077, p. 499, a12-b4)\", \"code\": \"DILA\", \"id\": \"relation_16\", \"record_id\": \"A000885:A025524\", \"rights_status\": \"pending_registry_review\", \"version\": \"2026-09\"}, {\"citation\": \"《續傳燈錄》卷5：「雪竇顯禪師法嗣……稱心守明禪師」(CBETA, T51, no. 2077, p. 499, a12-20)\", \"code\": \"DILA\", \"id\": \"relation_17\", \"record_id\": \"A000885:A025525\", \"rights_status\": \"pending_registry_review\", \"version\": \"2026-09\"}, {\"citation\": \"《續傳燈錄》卷5：「雪竇顯禪師法嗣……證聖守環禪師」(CBETA, T51, no. 2077, p. 499, a12-26)\", \"code\": \"DILA\", \"id\": \"relation_18\", \"record_id\": \"A000885:A025527\", \"rights_status\": \"pending_registry_review\", \"version\": \"2026-09\"}, {\"citation\": \"《續傳燈錄》卷5：「雪竇顯禪師法嗣……報本有蘭禪師」(CBETA, T51, no. 2077, p. 499, a12-17)\", \"code\": \"DILA\", \"id\": \"relation_19\", \"record_id\": \"A000885:A025528\", \"rights_status\": \"pending_registry_review\", \"version\": \"2026-09\"}, {\"citation\": \"《續傳燈錄》卷5：「雪竇顯禪師法嗣……稱心清演禪師」(CBETA, T51, no. 2077, p. 499, a12-26)\", \"code\": \"DILA\", \"id\": \"relation_20\", \"record_id\": \"A000885:A025531\", \"rights_status\": \"pending_registry_review\", \"version\": \"2026-09\"}, {\"citation\": \"《續傳燈錄》卷5：「雪竇顯禪師法嗣……乾明知應禪師」(CBETA, T51, no. 2077, p. 499, a12-23)\", \"code\": \"DILA\", \"id\": \"relation_21\", \"record_id\": \"A000885:A025532\", \"rights_status\": \"pending_registry_review\", \"version\": \"20